  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (BB124.19.P400, BB124.19.P401 and Planning Statement, received 16/10/2019] and Proposed First Floor Plan [received 10/12/2019]) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - Prior to first beneficial use of the development hereby approved, full details of cycle parking in the form of Sheffield stands to the front of the site in line with London Plan standards must be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority, facilitating short-stay (visitor/customer) cycle parking and at least one full-enclosed and sheltered long-stay (staff) cycle parking space. The approved storage must be made available for use prior to occupation and thereafter retained for use at all times without obstruction.",
    "Condition : 4 - The identified first floor premises at 227-229 Chiswick High Road shall be restricted to use as an 'escape room' and within Use Class D2 and shall be used for no other purposes unless permission is granted otherwise.",
    "Condition : 5 - The D2 use hereby permitted for an 'escape room' occupying the first floor unit of 227-229 Chiswick High Road shall not be carried on outside the following times: 10:00 - 22:30 Monday to Sunday.",
    "Condition : 6 - The existing windows in the rear elevation shall remain obscured/frosted and shall not be repaired or replaced otherwise than with obscured glazing."
